0..75 Comment "// Implicit parameters: the telescope `@[a : Type]` after a function\'s name"
76..145 Comment "// binds parameters a use supplies by name in the instantiation slot,"
146..223 Comment "// `same[a = Integer](3)`, in any order (#315). The implicit and the explicit"
224..299 Comment "// parameters merge into one telescope, each after every parameter its type"
300..372 Comment "// names, ties kept in the written order; which ones are implicit is the"
373..452 Comment "// declaration\'s metadata, so the declared type is the one the function written"
453..530 Comment "// with every parameter explicit, in the merged order, has. A call that omits"
531..605 Comment "// its implicits has each one solved from its arguments and the type it is"
606..652 Comment "// checked against (#1216). What refuses is in"
653..710 Comment "// `../pathological/classifier/implicit-telescope.gandr`."
